    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41580" root="وتح" body-key="w">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتُحَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَوْتُحُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتَاحَةٌ</span> (S, K) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُتُوحَةٌ</span> (K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتْحَةٌ</span>, (L,) <i>It</i> (a thing, S, or a
gift, K) <i>was little,</i> or <i>small, and paltry, mean,</i>
or <i>contemptible.</i> (S, L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتَحَ عَطَآءَهُ</span>, aor.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَتِحُ</span>; (K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوتحهُ</span></b> ; (S, K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتّحهُ</span></b> ,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوْتِيحٌ</span>; (S;) <i>He made his gift little,</i> or
<i>small,</i> (S, K,) <i>and paltry, mean,</i> or <i>contemptible.</i>
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهُ الشَّىْءَ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوتح</span></b>  <i>He made the thing
little to him.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوتح</span></b>  <i>He became a
person of little property.</i> (K)

